{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"length","index":0,"message":{"content":"It did not merely rise; it surged with a ferocity that tore the water into white foam against the ancient blocks. The community had prayed for rain to save the crops, but never imagined it would demand such a toll in return. By午后 accord, the river had swollen into a brown, churning beast that whipped around the bridge’s arches like a living thing. The hollow sound of water striking stone grew louder, a rhythmic pounding that seemed to vibrate in the bones of anyone standing on the bank.\n\nOld Silas, who had watched the bridge outlive two empires, stood trembling on the riverbank, his grip on his cane white-knuckled. He knew the masonry was strong, but he also knew that water had no mind to reason with. It only knew the path of least resistance, and for centuries, the bridge had been more than just a crossing; it had been a scar on the flow, a knot in the current that had slowly, imperceptibly weakened the very earth that supported it. As the sun began to dip, casting long, bruised shadows across the rushing water, a loud, sickening crack echoed from the center span. Dust rained down into the current, and the first cobblestone slid","role":"assistant"}}],"created":1792460663,"id":"chatcmpl-18e01979f56c92bb0063","model":"qwen3.8-27b-fp8","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"aien_sampling":{"greedy_tokens":0,"kept":[248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320